{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09606","headline":"虢州送郑兴宗弟归扶风别庐 · 岑参","name":"虢州送郑兴宗弟归扶风别庐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佐郡已三载，岂能长後时。\n出关少亲友，赖汝常相随。\n今旦忽言别，怆然俱泪垂。\n平生沧洲意，独有青山知。\n州县不敢说，云霄谁敢期。\n因怀东谿老，最忆南峰缁。\n爲我多种药，还山应未迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09606.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09606","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}